        {
          "text": "Ne abaana baUlamu bali abalulu beitswoni, abalasi bobuyingo; bali nende abaana abanji, kata nende abeetsukhulu, eshikhumi namakhumi karaano. Abo bosi bali abaana baBenyamini.",
